---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/zeno-race.css';
---
<ToolLayout title="追上那只乌龟 · 越来越小的芝诺悖论" description="还差一点，再靠近一点。兔子不停向前追近乌龟，镜头同时平滑放大剩余的缝，从米到微米，看见芝诺悖论里始终还有的下一段。展开解释，还能探索完整时间与有限的相遇时刻。" currentSlug="zeno-race">
  <header class="zr-intro" slot="header">
    <span class="zr-eyebrow">追上那只乌龟 / ZENO’S PARADOX</span>
    <h1>还差一点。<br /><em>那就再靠近一点。</em></h1>
    <p>刚跑到乌龟待过的地方，它又往前了一点。<br class="zr-mobile-break" />把注意力留给这段越来越小的距离。</p>
  </header>
  <section class="zr-lab" id="zeno-race-lab" aria-label="兔子追乌龟交互实验" data-mode="steps" data-stage="0" data-running="false">
    <div class="zr-scene">
      <div class="zr-scene-top"><span>ALWAYS A LITTLE CLOSER</span><span id="zr-stage-label">起点 · 第 0 段</span></div>
      <div class="zr-live-metrics" aria-label="逐段追赶的模型读数">
        <div class="zr-gap-heading"><span id="zr-gap-label">还差</span><strong id="zr-gap">10 m</strong><span>兔子与乌龟的当前间距</span></div>
        <div class="zr-segment-heading"><span id="zr-segment-label">第 1 段已用</span><strong id="zr-segment-elapsed">0 s</strong><span>本段共 <b id="zr-segment-duration">1 s</b></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="zr-segment-meter"><div id="zr-segment-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="当前段的模型时间进度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0"><i></i></div><span id="zr-segment-state">从上一条线，跑到下一条线</span></div>
      <div class="zr-total-metrics"><span>累计用时 <b id="zr-total-time">0 s</b></span><span>兔子累计跑过 <b id="zr-total-distance">0 m</b></span></div>
      <p class="zr-metric-note" id="zr-metric-note">模型读数取约 3 位有效数字；慢放时长不等于赛跑用时</p>
      <p class="zr-gap-context" id="zr-gap-context">每一段之后，都还有下一段</p>
      <div class="zr-phase"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span id="zr-phase-label">边追近，边放大 · 脚步不停</span></div>
      <svg id="zr-track" viewBox="0 100 900 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="zr-track-title zr-track-desc">
        <title id="zr-track-title">越来越小的间距</title><desc id="zr-track-desc">两只动物连续向前，镜头同时平滑放大地面，屏幕上的间距仍然逐渐缩小。紫色与绿色标记表示精确位置，插画在间距外侧逐渐缩小并过渡为持久的小点。插画大小是示意，不代表真实动物体积。</desc>
        <defs>
          <radialGradient id="zr-glow"><stop stop-color="#ded4e8" stop-opacity=".7"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ded4e8" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
          <linearGradient id="zr-gap-fill"><stop stop-color="#a78bad" stop-opacity=".12"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9ba883" stop-opacity=".2"/></linearGradient>
          <symbol id="zr-rabbit-art" viewBox="-44 -62 88 74">
            <ellipse cx="-1" cy="8" rx="35" ry="5" fill="#524d6520"/>
            <ellipse cx="-11" cy="-11" rx="23" ry="17" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <circle cx="-34" cy="-11" r="8" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <ellipse cx="13" cy="-43" rx="6" ry="18" transform="rotate(-19 13 -43)" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <ellipse cx="26" cy="-42" rx="5" ry="19" transform="rotate(13 26 -42)" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M11-54 16-35M28-54 24-35" stroke="#d3a9b8" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <ellipse cx="20" cy="-24" rx="17" ry="15" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M29-9 36 3 23 4M-17-4-27 5-5 6" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#777184" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="27" cy="-27" r="2.3" fill="#4c455b"/><ellipse cx="37" cy="-20" rx="3" ry="2" fill="#c794a4"/>
            <path d="m7-16 9 4" stroke="#b89bc2" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </symbol>
          <symbol id="zr-turtle-art" viewBox="-44 -40 88 52">
            <ellipse cx="0" cy="8" rx="36" ry="5" fill="#524d6520"/>
            <path d="m-27-1-4 8h12l3-9M7-1 10 8h12l-5-12" fill="#a3ac73" stroke="#69734f" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M20-12c13-15 27-9 22 1-3 6-14 6-22 7" fill="#b9bf8a" stroke="#69734f" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="m-29-5-10-3 7 9" fill="#a3ac73" stroke="#69734f" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M-33-4C-34-42 21-43 25-4Z" fill="#818c5a" stroke="#5d6944" stroke-width="1.8"/>
            <path d="m-7-32 9 10-4 16M-7-32-19-17-11-5M-19-17l-12 2M2-22l18 6M-19-17 2-22" fill="none" stroke="#bdc497" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M-33-4h58" stroke="#ced4a7" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="36" cy="-17" r="1.8" fill="#36452d"/>
          </symbol>

          <symbol id="zr-rabbit-head" viewBox="-22 -43 44 58"><ellipse cx="-9" cy="-26" rx="5" ry="16" transform="rotate(-13 -9 -26)" fill="#fffaf7" stroke="#807087" stroke-width="1.5"/><ellipse cx="8" cy="-28" rx="5" ry="16" transform="rotate(10 8 -28)" fill="#fffaf7" stroke="#807087" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cy="0" r="17" fill="#fffaf7" stroke="#807087" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="7" cy="-3" r="2" fill="#685571"/><path d="m15 3 4 1-4 2" fill="#c893a8"/></symbol>
          <symbol id="zr-turtle-shell" viewBox="-23 -19 46 38"><ellipse rx="22" ry="18" fill="#879664" stroke="#637649" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m0-17 10 9-3 17-7 8-11-9 2-17ZM-20-7l11-2M10-8l11 2M7 9l12 3M-11 8l-9 4" fill="none" stroke="#bec89d" stroke-width="1.4"/></symbol>
        </defs>
        <g id="zr-camera">
        <g id="zr-world"><g id="zr-ground-grid"></g></g>
        <g id="zr-history-outlines" fill="none" stroke="#a99ab6" stroke-width="1"></g>
        <rect id="zr-gap-wash" x="170" y="196" width="560" height="65" rx="15" fill="url(#zr-gap-fill)"/>
        <path id="zr-old-marker" d="M730 172V285" stroke="#baa789" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/>
        <g id="zr-rabbit" transform="translate(170 224)"><g class="zr-whole"><use href="#zr-rabbit-art" x="-44" y="-62" width="88" height="74"/></g><g class="zr-head" opacity="0"><use href="#zr-rabbit-head" x="-22" y="-43" width="44" height="58"/></g><circle class="zr-point" cy="-5" r="6" fill="#876096" stroke="#fcf9ff" stroke-width="3" opacity="0"/></g>
        <g id="zr-turtle" transform="translate(730 224)"><g class="zr-whole"><use href="#zr-turtle-art" x="-44" y="-40" width="88" height="52"/></g><g class="zr-head" opacity="0"><use href="#zr-turtle-shell" x="-23" y="-24" width="46" height="38"/></g><circle class="zr-point" cy="-5" r="6" fill="#6d804a" stroke="#fcf9ff" stroke-width="3" opacity="0"/></g>
        <circle id="zr-rabbit-pin" cy="235" r="2" fill="#876096"/><circle id="zr-turtle-pin" cy="235" r="2" fill="#6d804a"/>
        </g>
        <path id="zr-gap-bracket" d="M170 270v9H730v-9" fill="none" stroke="#a58aae" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text id="zr-gap-svg" x="450" y="311" text-anchor="middle" fill="#83708e" font-size="17" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace">10 m</text>
        <text id="zr-old-label" x="730" y="157" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a39174" font-size="12">它刚才的位置</text>
        <g id="zr-ruler" transform="translate(60 357)"><path d="M0-5V5M0 0H120M120-5V5" fill="none" stroke="#a595ae"/><text id="zr-ruler-value" x="136" y="4" fill="#8c7a94" font-size="12">标尺</text></g>
      </svg>
      <div class="zr-camera-caption"><span id="zr-scale-label">米的尺度</span><span id="zr-camera-label">镜头 ×1</span></div>
      <div class="zr-observation"><p id="zr-observation">先跑到乌龟现在的位置。到那里时，它会在哪儿？</p></div>
      <div class="zr-main-actions"><button type="button" class="zr-primary" id="zr-next">再靠近一点 <span>→</span></button><button type="button" id="zr-play" aria-pressed="false">自动追赶</button><button type="button" id="zr-reset" aria-label="回到起点">↺ <span>重来</span></button></div>
      <p id="zr-play-note" class="zr-play-note">连续慢放与放大同时进行；插画逐渐缩成位置点，不代表动物体积。</p>
      <p id="zr-status" class="zr-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">准备好了，试着再靠近一点。</p>
      <p class="zr-resolution" id="zr-resolution" hidden></p>
    </div>
    <aside class="zr-controls" aria-label="赛跑设置">
      <div class="zr-control-heading"><span>THE STARTING POINT</span><h2>给乌龟一个先手</h2></div>
      <label for="zr-lead">乌龟领先 <output id="zr-lead-value">10 m</output><input id="zr-lead" type="range" min="0" max="30" step="1" value="10" /></label>
      <label for="zr-rabbit-speed">兔子速度 <output id="zr-rabbit-speed-value">10 m/s</output><input id="zr-rabbit-speed" type="range" min="0" max="20" step="0.1" value="10" /></label>
      <label for="zr-turtle-speed">乌龟速度 <output id="zr-turtle-speed-value">1 m/s</output><input id="zr-turtle-speed" type="range" min="0" max="20" step="0.1" value="1" /></label>
      <p class="zr-control-note">匀速、同向、不停步。调整参数会暂停，并回到起点。</p>
      <div class="zr-shrink-history"><span id="zr-history-heading">距离，一次次缩小</span><div id="zr-gap-history" aria-label="最近几段的剩余距离"></div><p id="zr-ratio-note">每到一个旧位置，间距缩成原来的 1/10。</p></div>
      <div class="zr-legend"><span><i class="zr-dot rabbit"></i>兔子</span><span><i class="zr-dot turtle"></i>乌龟</span></div>
      <p class="zr-control-note">紫、绿标记是两者的位置。追赶与镜头放大同时进行，格线不断展开，间距仍然缩小。插画平滑缩小成持久的位置点；这是便于观察的示意大小，不代表动物体积。</p>
      <p class="zr-model-note">这里一直观察“追到旧位置”的有限步骤。每步还差一点，是这个观察方法的特点。</p>
    </aside>
    <details id="zr-explanation" class="zr-explanation">
      <summary><span>看看解释</span><small>现实中会追上吗？</small><span class="zr-summary-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary>
      <div class="zr-explanation-body">
        <div class="zr-insight"><span>THE MISSING PIECE</span><h2>没有最后一段，<br />也可以有相遇的时刻。</h2><p>当兔子更快、乌龟也在向前走且有初始领先时，每次都追到乌龟的旧位置，这些有限编号的时刻就一直在相遇之前。但兔子并没有照着编号停下、等待。分段是我们的观察方法，运动和时间本身仍然连续。</p><p>默认设置里，选中的时刻是 1、1.1、1.11……秒，越来越接近 <strong>10/9 秒</strong>。相遇是它们的极限，不是某张“最后的截图”。到 1.2 秒，兔子已经跑在前面。</p></div>
        <div class="zr-modebar" role="group" aria-label="解释中的观察方式"><button type="button" id="zr-mode-steps" aria-pressed="true">回到逐段追赶</button><button type="button" id="zr-mode-continuous" aria-pressed="false">查看完整时间 →</button></div>
        <div id="zr-complete-view" hidden>
          <svg id="zr-full-track" viewBox="0 0 900 210" role="img" aria-label="完整时间里的兔子与乌龟"><path d="M40 85H860M40 158H860" stroke="#dcd3e2" stroke-dasharray="4 7"/><g id="zr-meeting-marker"><path d="M0 18V184" stroke="#9c7bad" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><text y="203" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8c6f9b" font-size="13">相遇位置</text></g><g id="zr-full-rabbit"><use href="#zr-rabbit-art" x="-35" y="-48" width="70" height="59"/></g><g id="zr-full-turtle"><use href="#zr-turtle-art" x="-35" y="-32" width="70" height="42"/></g></svg>
          <div class="zr-full-readout"><span>兔子 <b id="zr-rabbit-position">0 m</b></span><span>乌龟 <b id="zr-turtle-position">10 m</b></span><span id="zr-full-gap">仍差 10 m</span></div>
          <p id="zr-full-observation"></p>
          <button type="button" id="zr-continuous-play" aria-pressed="false">播放完整时间</button>
        </div>
        <div class="zr-explain-metrics"><div><span>上一完整段用时</span><strong id="zr-segment">尚未开始</strong></div><div><span>累计模型时间</span><strong id="zr-time">0 s</strong></div><div><span id="zr-tail-label">距相遇还需</span><strong id="zr-tail">≈ 1.111111 s</strong></div><div><span id="zr-limit-heading">相遇发生在</span><strong id="zr-limit-time">10/9 s</strong><p id="zr-limit-detail">≈ 1.111111… 秒 · 100/9 米处</p></div></div>
        <div class="zr-explain-actions"><button type="button" id="zr-meet">把时钟拨到相遇 →</button><button type="button" id="zr-compare">直接看默认的 1.2 秒 ↗</button><button type="button" id="zr-replay">从头重播当前观察</button></div>
        <section class="zr-time-section" aria-label="选定截图与完整连续时间的对照"><div class="zr-time-heading"><h2>两种观察，同一段时间</h2><span id="zr-timeline-caption">有限步骤越来越靠近相遇线</span></div>
      <svg id="zr-timeline" viewBox="0 0 1100 180" role="img" aria-labelledby="zr-timeline-title zr-timeline-desc">
        <title id="zr-timeline-title">截图序列与完整时间轴</title><desc id="zr-timeline-desc">上方标出每一张选定截图的时刻，下方是可以穿过相遇时刻的连续时间。截图时刻越来越密，但不会覆盖相遇之后。</desc>
        <defs><marker id="zr-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="m0 0 6 3-6 3" fill="#746780"/></marker><pattern id="zr-future-hatch" width="7" height="7" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(35)"><path d="M0 0V7" stroke="#a695b33d" stroke-width="2"/></pattern></defs>
        <g id="zr-future-region"></g>
        <text x="0" y="51" class="zr-axis-label">选定的截图</text><text x="0" y="121" class="zr-axis-label">完整的时间</text>
        <path id="zr-snapshot-baseline" d="M150 47H820" stroke="#d2c8d8" stroke-width="3"/>
        <path id="zr-continuous-baseline" d="M150 117H1060" stroke="#c8bfce" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#zr-arrow)"/>
        <g id="zr-segments"></g><g id="zr-snapshots"></g>
        <g id="zr-limit-line"><path d="M0 20V142" stroke="#9562a5" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><text id="zr-limit-axis-text" y="164" text-anchor="middle">相遇 t*</text></g>
        <path id="zr-live-progress" d="M150 117H150" stroke="#746080" stroke-width="5"/>
        <circle id="zr-time-cursor" cx="150" cy="117" r="7" fill="#746080" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text id="zr-axis-zero" x="150" y="164" class="zr-axis-zero">0 s</text><text x="1060" y="164" text-anchor="end" id="zr-axis-end">1.5 s →</text>
      </svg>
      <div id="zr-continuous-controls" hidden><label for="zr-scrub">拖动完整时钟 <output id="zr-scrub-value">0 s</output></label><input id="zr-scrub" type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="1" value="0" /><p>拖动会暂停。模型时间连续变化；相遇线之后，兔子还会接着跑。</p></div>

        <div class="zr-sequence" id="zr-sequence" aria-label="已选择的截图时刻"></div></section>
        <div class="zr-notes"><section><h3>把相遇直接算出来</h3><p>领先距离为 L，兔速为 a，龟速为 b。两者位置是 x兔 = at、x龟 = L + bt。若 L &gt; 0 且 a &gt; b，相遇时刻 t* = L / (a − b)。</p><p>当 0 &lt; b &lt; a，令 q = b/a，第 n 段后的间距为 Lqⁿ，距相遇还需 t*qⁿ。每个有限 n 的余量都大于零，但它们的极限是零。</p></section><section><h3>这个画面有哪些约定？</h3><p>追赶和镜头放大连续发生，经过一个旧位置时不会为放大而停步。模型时间不断前进，但慢放倍数逐渐增加，让越来越短的下一段仍然看得清。位置、格线和旧位置使用同一套投影；插画另用平滑缩小的示意尺寸，最后保留成位置点。屏幕间距采用连续压缩尺度，实际间距请看数字与标尺。动画播放时长不等于真实用时；持续展示相遇之前的区间，不表示真实赛跑永远追不上。微小距离是理想连续模型的数学延伸。</p><p>页面最多展示 200 个有限步骤。微小余量用对数独立计算；累计时间即使四舍五入到相遇时刻，也不表示这一步真的追上。</p><p>L = 0 时起点已相遇；乌龟静止且兔子向前时第一段追上；兔子不比乌龟快时，正的领先距离不会收敛到零。</p></section></div>
        <div class="zr-sources"><a href="https://sites.pitt.edu/~jdnorton/teaching/paradox/chapters/Zeno/Zeno.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">匹兹堡大学 · 芝诺悖论 ↗</a><a href="https://pi.math.cornell.edu/~mec/Summer2009/ABjorndahl/tools.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">康奈尔大学 · 几何级数 ↗</a></div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>
  <nav class="zr-related" aria-label="继续探索"><span>继续做一个思想实验</span><a href="/tools/paper-fold/">一张纸，折到月球 →</a><a href="/tools/double-pendulum/">双摆：一点不同，两条命运 →</a></nav>
  <noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后可以观察逐段收缩的间距。默认第 n 段后还差 10×0.1ⁿ 米，每个有限步骤仍有余量；完整赛跑则在 10/9 秒相遇。</p></noscript>
</ToolLayout>
<script>import '../../scripts/zeno-race/main';</script>
